    "text": "去了好几次，有时很好吃，有时不好吃，不知道是不是有2波厨子。饭点有些吵闹。有一次点了一杯0.4L的水，服务员直接裸着上了一杯水，不是那种密封的塑料瓶或者玻璃瓶，后来就再也没去过。",
    "textTranslated": "I've been there several times; sometimes the food is great, sometimes it's not. I wonder if they have two teams of chefs. It gets a bit noisy during mealtimes. Once, I ordered a 0.4L glass of water, and the server brought it to me completely naked—not in a sealed plastic or glass bottle. I haven't been back since."
  },
